      ],
      "answer": [
        "ZCL_ORDER_HANDLER is the central class for validating and booking orders. It is owned by team Order-to-Cash.",
        "It uses ZCL_ORDER_VALIDATOR for the checks and writes the booking to ZTB_ORDER_LOG."
      ]
